        ontoksd:CA_Task406_CM05_Learning,
        ontoksd:CA_Task406_CM08_Learning,
        ontoksd:CA_Task406_CM20_Learning ;
    ontoksd:hasInstructionalStatement "Assume valid, distinct records. Immediate FIM produces zero for every count. Submit source code; explicit test comparison and judgment is optional."@en,
        "Display total students, boys and girls; totals by sex for each condition; the union, each inclusive pairwise intersection and the triple intersection. Count each student once per category, allowing the same student in distinct applicable categories."@en,
        "Read each student name, sex code M/F and three separate Boolean values for myopia, hypermetropia and astigmatism. Check the name FIM before requesting any remaining fields and exclude the sentinel from all counts."@en ;
